PART 10 — GRAMMAR CORRECTION CARDS

Show a detailed correction card when the learner requests feedback or when the selected correction setting allows it.

Example:

YOU SAID:

Я живу в Львів.

CORRECT UKRAINIAN:

Я живу у Львові.

ENGLISH:

I live in Lviv.

WHAT CHANGED:

Львів → Львові.

GRAMMAR:

The locative case is used with у/в when expressing location.

ADDITIONAL EXAMPLE:

Я працюю у Львові.

I work in Lviv.

PRACTICE:

Try saying the corrected sentence again.

Buttons:

* Hear Correct Pronunciation.
